  "title": "nVent Launches Smart DC Distribution Unit to Power and Protect Next-Generation Telecom Infrastructure",
  "summary": "Improved monitoring, cybersecurity, and compact design enable reliable power distribution for 5G, edge computing, and outdoor network deploymentsnVent Electric plc (NYSE: NVent), a global leader in electrical connection and protection solutions, today announced the launch of the nVent SCHROFF Smart DC Distribution Unit (Smart DCDU)—a next-generation intelligent DC power distribution solution engineered for modern telecom networks, edge data centers, and mission-critical infrastructure.",
